WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.624 --> 00:00:13.250
Mayor Bloom was still out of breath.

2
00:00:14.511 --> 00:00:17.292
Detective Smith got up from his desk so the mayor could sit down.

3
00:00:17.312 --> 00:00:20.334
"Tell me what happened, Mayor," the detective said.

4
00:00:21.094 --> 00:00:22.475
Mayor Bloom took a deep breath.

5
00:00:22.495 --> 00:00:26.537
"I was working in my office.

6
00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:30.840
Suddenly dozens of monkeys and apes stormed into the building.

7
00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:33.377
They were all wearing armor.

8
00:00:34.017 --> 00:00:36.639
They held spears, axes, and swords!

9
00:00:37.759 --> 00:00:43.242
One ape—perhaps a gibbon—said that Sun Wukong was now king of Metro City!

10
00:00:44.603 --> 00:00:47.425
Then Wukong walked in and sat at my desk!"

11
00:00:50.526 --> 00:00:52.387
"Nobody takes over our city!"

12
00:00:52.908 --> 00:00:54.568
Detective Smith rolled up his sleeves.

13
00:00:54.588 --> 00:00:56.830
"I'm going over there right now!"

14
00:00:58.731 --> 00:01:00.912
A huge wall now surrounded City Hall.

15
00:01:01.552 --> 00:01:04.635
Monkeys and apes, armed with weapons, stood along the wall.

16
00:01:07.197 --> 00:01:08.137
They looked dangerous.

17
00:01:13.121 --> 00:01:15.083
Detective Smith found a gate and knocked.

18
00:01:16.524 --> 00:01:18.606
The gate opened, and a gorilla stepped out.

19
00:01:18.626 --> 00:01:21.408
"What do you want?"

20
00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:22.789
the gorilla asked.

21
00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:24.911
Detective Smith cleared his throat.

22
00:01:24.931 --> 00:01:28.354
"I need to speak to Sun Wukong."

23
00:01:29.034 --> 00:01:30.075
The gorilla grunted.

24
00:01:30.095 --> 00:01:31.196
"Follow me."

25
00:01:34.716 --> 00:01:37.118
Soon Detective Smith stood in Mayor Bloom's office.

26
00:01:37.638 --> 00:01:40.280
Wukong sat at the desk while Bajie stood next to him.

27
00:01:41.241 --> 00:01:42.962
The gorilla snarled at the detective.

28
00:01:42.982 --> 00:01:45.704
"You're supposed to bow before the Monkey King!"

29
00:01:45.724 --> 00:01:47.385
"Are you kidding?"

30
00:01:47.725 --> 00:01:48.706
Detective Smith said.

31
00:01:48.726 --> 00:01:51.067
"Metro City doesn't have a king."

32
00:01:52.168 --> 00:01:53.609
The monkeys and apes gasped.

33
00:01:54.189 --> 00:01:57.191
"It's okay," Wukong said.

34
00:01:57.212 --> 00:02:00.073
"Detective Smith is new to having a king.

35
00:02:00.594 --> 00:02:03.456
He can be excused for not acting the right way."

36
00:02:04.352 --> 00:02:05.893
"Where did your army come from?"

37
00:02:06.293 --> 00:02:07.414
Detective Smith asked.

38
00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:11.257
"They came from the Fruit and Flower Mountain," Wukong said.

39
00:02:11.277 --> 00:02:13.018
"That's my other kingdom.

40
00:02:13.779 --> 00:02:16.160
And do you like the new wall I placed around this building?

41
00:02:16.481 --> 00:02:17.982
It's made from one of my hairs."

42
00:02:20.603 --> 00:02:22.145
Detective Smith narrowed his eyes.

43
00:02:22.165 --> 00:02:24.586
"You can't just take over this city!"

44
00:02:24.606 --> 00:02:26.227
Wukong shrugged.

45
00:02:26.247 --> 00:02:28.429
"Of course I can."

46
00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:31.271
Bajie stepped forward and smiled.

47
00:02:31.291 --> 00:02:42.287
"Guards! Put this man in "We will have a wonderful feast!"

48
00:02:42.707 --> 00:02:44.067
the Demon of Black Rain said.

49
00:02:44.807 --> 00:02:46.328
He was in the kitchen with his servants.

50
00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:51.449
Several demons chopped vegetables while others were busy grinding spices.

51
00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:55.090
Two demons prepared a large barrel of brine.

52
00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.171
"Master," one of the demons said.

53
00:02:58.191 --> 00:03:01.532
"We're going to pickle that purple monster."

54
00:03:02.528 --> 00:03:03.829
The demon patted his belly.

55
00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.072
"That sounds delicious!"

56
00:03:08.273 --> 00:03:10.234
Just then there was a knock at the cave's door.

57
00:03:10.254 --> 00:03:12.796
"Shall I answer that, Master?"

58
00:03:13.177 --> 00:03:13.857
a demon asked.

59
00:03:13.877 --> 00:03:18.101
"No, I'll answer it," the Demon of Black Rain said.

60
00:03:18.121 --> 00:03:21.003
"It might be that annoying goddess."

61
00:03:24.846 --> 00:03:27.248
The demon opened the door and saw the mountain's spirit.

62
00:03:27.268 --> 00:03:30.451
"Oh, it's you," he said.

63
00:03:30.471 --> 00:03:31.852
"What do you want?"

64
00:03:33.152 --> 00:03:36.274
"Please, let me in," the spirit said.

65
00:03:36.294 --> 00:03:40.717
"I have important information for you."

66
00:03:42.658 --> 00:03:43.618
The demon let her in.

67
00:03:48.621 --> 00:03:52.183
He poked his head out, looked both ways, and then slammed the door shut.

68
00:03:53.424 --> 00:03:54.285
The lock clicked.

69
00:03:54.305 --> 00:03:57.647
"Well, what do you have to tell me?"

70
00:03:58.747 --> 00:03:59.868
The spirit looked worried.

71
00:04:00.896 --> 00:04:03.978
"I was just talking to a goddess.

72
00:04:04.758 --> 00:04:06.940
She's really mad at you."

73
00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:08.701
The demon shrugged.

74
00:04:08.721 --> 00:04:11.702
"So what?"

75
00:04:11.722 --> 00:04:16.525
"She told me she's going to come up here," the spirit said.

76
00:04:17.306 --> 00:04:20.788
"She plans to rescue the Tang Monk!"

77
00:04:21.888 --> 00:04:23.089
"Oh yeah?"

78
00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.630
The demon narrowed his eyes.

79
00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:28.052
"I'll be ready for her!"
